Description:

Formula ported from an original JIT formula by Quasihedron @ Deviantart.
Use scalingplus and translate to replicate original sliders.

   xn := x*x*x - ymul*x*y*y - zmul*x*z*z + Cx;
   yn := -y*y*y + ymul*y*x*x - amul*y*z*z + Cy;
   zn := z*z*z - zmul*z*x*x + amul*z*y*y + Cz;